{"sections":[{"slug":"可分代数","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"可分代数"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可分代数</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"可分代数"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">含幺交换环</span> $R$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的可分代数是满足如下等价条件的</span> $R$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span> $A$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$A$ <span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $A\\otimes_R A^{\\mathrm{op}}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/投射模","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">投射模</span>"}},{"Plain":" (<span lang=\"zh\">注意此时它一定是有限生成的</span>);</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">乘法映射</span> $A\\otimes_R A^{\\mathrm{op}} \\to A$ (<span lang=\"zh\">作为</span> $A\\otimes_R A^{\\mathrm{op}}$-<span lang=\"zh\">模同态</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">存在截面</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注意不要求</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是交换代数</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与可分域扩张的关系</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">可分代数是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可分扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可分域扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的推广</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $k\\hookrightarrow K$ <span lang=\"zh\">是域扩张</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则它是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可分扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可分扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">当且仅当</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">是可分</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>.</p>\n<p><em><span lang=\"zh\">证明概要</span></em>. <span lang=\"zh\">假设</span> $k\\hookrightarrow K$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/可分扩张","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">可分扩张</span>"}},{"Plain":". <span lang=\"zh\">那么存在</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的一组</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">基</span> $\\{e_1,\\cdots,e_n\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">以及对偶基</span> $\\{f_1,\\cdots,f_n\\}$ <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span>\n$\\operatorname{Tr}_{E/F}(e_if_j) = \\delta_{ij}$, <span lang=\"zh\">且</span> $\\sum_{i=1}^n e_i f_i = 1$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">令</span>\n$$\r\nx = \\sum_{i=1}^n e_i \\otimes f_i \\in K\\otimes_k K.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">乘法映射</span> $\\mu\\colon K\\otimes_k K\\to K$ <span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $x$ <span lang=\"zh\">映射到</span> $1$.\n<span lang=\"zh\">截面</span> $K \\to K\\otimes_k K$ <span lang=\"zh\">可由</span> $a\\mapsto ax$ <span lang=\"zh\">给出</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">另一方面</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">假设</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">是可分</span> $k$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $k\\hookrightarrow K$ <span lang=\"zh\">不是可分扩张</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即存在</span> $a\\in K$, <span lang=\"zh\">其在</span> $k$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的极小多项式有重根</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $K\\otimes_k K$ <span lang=\"zh\">有幂零元</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}